r a sorcerer, not a geomaner.&quot;<br /> Papa Bear: &quot;Yes... but if we'd already had one we never would have gotten into this mess in the first place!&quot;<br /> <br /> <br /> ST: &quot;The 'nemissary' grins evilly, and a Moonshadow caste mark bleeds on his forehead.&quot;<br /> PC2: &quot;...I'm gonna activate a couple Charms.&quot;<br /> PC3: &quot;I ready my weapon.&quot;<br /> PC1: &quot;And I'll take my turn to s*** myself.&quot;<br /> <br /> <br /> PC1: &quot;Alright, this is too many mental circles for me to think in, I'm just gonna be a horse.&quot;<br /> <br /> <br /> Papa Bear: &quot;Think, don't feel! Use your training!&quot;<br /> PC2: &quot;That is the EXACT OPPOSITE of what you have been training us!&quot;<br /> <br /> <br /> NPC: &quot;It is not for me to know how my secret master comes by his information.&quot;<br /> PC2: &quot;Ah. 'His.' Thank you.&quot;<br /> <br /> <br /> Papa Bear: *singing* &quot;Congratulations, bub, you've joined the club, and everyone here agrees; we have the finest blend of nearly honest men....&quot; *suddenly speaking normally* &quot;Welcome to the Forgotten Suns.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Murcushio: Sure, you avoid all that messy withdrawal, but you still need to <i>stop doing heroin</i> (for the purposes of this discussion your cousin is named Heroin).","edited":{"userid":4657,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4657-maxastro","user":"MaxAstro","date":". 08-13-2015, 03:56 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4657-maxastro","name":"MaxAstro","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4657_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"227"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-13T12:20:54-07:00","id":625726,"title":"","content":"*Shocked*&quot;Gods! Is that?...&quot;<br /> *awkwardly*&quot;Yeaa