remind me to punch the dawn for what his previous incarnation did!<br /> P2: what did he do?<br /> P1: you know the fairfolk that's not fairfolk.<br /> P2: Yeah?<br /> P1: he got bored and made those.<br /> P2: Son of a...<br /> -------------------------<br /> P1: just don't accidentally drop the porn plants on our nude praying mortals.<br /> P2: why no.. oooh f*ck!<br /> P1: Is exactly what they would do.<br /> -----------------------------------------------<br /> P5: strip for me!<br /> -------------------------<br /> P1: TRY THAT AGAIN AND I WILL HIT YOU WITH PRESENCE POWERED BUREAUCRACY 'TILL YOU BLEED PAPERWORK!<br /> -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------<br /> P1: Sure take them back to camp but you have to deal with the side effects!<br /> P6: Side effects?<br /> P1: yeah like crying children wondering why mommy's an eight foot tall four armed war machine.<br /> P6: ... YOU ARE EVIL!<br /> P1: I'm so glad you noticed.<br /> -----------------------------<br /> P2: I'm the most trustworthy and honest person here!<br /> P1: don't worry I'll fix that!<br /> ---------------------------------------<br /> P4: IT'S MY SOLDIERS!<br /> P1: no they where your soldiers then I bureaucratically stole all of them then P5 stole them from me by being loud and shiny.<br /> --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------<br /> P2: CHEMICAL WARFARE!<br /> P1: &quot;tear eyed&quot; That's the spirit.<br /> -----------------------------------------------<br /> P1: Yes I'm bitter because I'm the only person whose domain is broken!<br /> P5: Mine was buried!<br /> P1: It's still whole, Mine's a broken upside down table lamp!<br /> ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------<br /> P1: You've been promoted to monkey!<br /> ---------------------------------------------------------<br /> P5: wait here and I'll show you some of our riches.<br /> P1: YOU ARE LITERALLY DRESSED IN GOLD!<br /> ------------------------------------------------------------------------<br /> P1:OH GODS, EVERYONE'S GETTING COMPASSION!<br /> ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------<br /> ST1: You've got a night caste for that.<br /> P1: No, I SOLVE problems, he CAUSES them!<br /> ----------------------------------------------------------------------<br /> P1: I LOVE BEING A HEARTLESS EVIL BASTARD!<br /> -------------------------------------------------------------------------------<br /> P5: what is trex?<br /> P1 with the most evil smile I have ever made: that's what these guy's where before i shoved them in the machine.<br /> P5: oooh...<br /> -------------------<br /> P1: Limit break for P6! Limit break for P6!... wait I'm in punch range and his is something with compassion... SHIT!<br /> P6: No successes.<br /> P1 Wohooo!<br /> ST1: you get a free success.<br /> P1: OH COME ON!<br /> -----------------------------<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm making the Tales of Exalts webcomic<br /> <a href=\"http://xanroth.deviantart.com/gallery/50854781/tales-of-exalts\" target=\"_blank\">http://xanroth.deviantart.com/galler...ales-of-exalts</a><br /> alchemical report <a href=\"http://xanroth.deviantart.com/gallery/54812164/Alchemical-Report\" target=\"_blank\">http://xanroth.deviantart.com/galler...hemical-Report</a><br /> the fall <a href=\"http://xanroth.deviantart.com/gallery/55265686/the-fall\" target=\"_blank\">http://xanroth.deviantart.com/gallery/55265686/the-fall</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4455-xanroth","name":"Xanroth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4455_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1072"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-20T14:36:39-08:00","id":834059,"title":"","content":"<b>Our likely-last 2nd Edition campaign, an Exalted Modern game, just ended. Here's the out of context quotes, presented in chronological order from the beginning of the game to the final session:</b><br /> <br /> Ray: I assume I can't use the points from the missing limb: hand thing to buy more arms?<br /> <br /> Mountain: I think &quot;Sun's Out, Guns Out&quot; is our circle name.<br /> <br /> Sabat: Can I use my chain daiklave - if I'm really fast - as a selfie stick?<br /> <br /> Sleeping Mountain: I don't actually have any dots of Familiar, but I do have four live animals in my pants.<br /> <br /> Ray: If I take my shoes off, I can count to 30!<br /> <br /> Mountain: Tiny, but well-trained martial arts foot, divine testicles.<br /> <br /> Mountain: I reserve the right to, if imprisoned somewhere for ten years, have a giant shaggy green mane.<br /> Abby: I reserve the right to imprison you for ten years.<br /> <br /> Abby: We are the Scooby Gang with our pet lion.<br /> <br /> ST: That's Resplendent Jim, he works here on Tuesdays.<br /> <br /> Mountain: It's kinda like a Raksha strip club, only there's more kung-fu involved.<br /> <br /> Sabat: Because when I think subtlety, I think Godzilla.<br /> <br /> ST: This is the most flannel a party of Sidereals has ever worn.<br /> <br /> Mountain: Perfect parry with a chainsaw.<br /> <br /> Abby: He was fated to die.<br /> Mountain: Was he fated to die without giving us any useful information??<br /> Abby:...apparently, yes.<br /> <br /> Abby: He wasn't naked when I stabbed him!<br /> <br /> Mountain: Actually, I think we're a pretty good argument FOR the Gold Faction, because honestly, how much worse could the Solars make it?<br /> <br /> ST: Here, plug <i>this</i> into the bear.<br /> <br /> ST: Now your nipples are whispering in torment!<br /> <br /> ST: The sky is, like, <i>on fire</i> or something, we don't know.<br /> <br /> Mountain: If you give me a ladder big enough...<i>I will flood the East!</i><br /> <br /> Hacophonane: I can, in fact, punch a hole through the Imperial Mountain and carry the fucker off. I can Carmen Sandiego the Imperial Mountain.<br /> <br /> Mountain: I failed my Temperance, I'm putting Soulsteel in the microwave to see what happens.<br /> <br /> Mountain: I put a bunch of batteries in my pocket on the basis that when I shoot them at people, they'll explode into acid and lightning.<br /> <br /> Mountain: I mean, shipping may be interfered with on account of apocalypse.<br /> Abby: No, they say two day shipping and they mean it! Neither rain nor sleet nor giant zombie.<br /> <br /> Mountain: I am gathering a social group of pilots who are motivated by sexual tension-<br /> Ray: And volleyball?<br /> <br /> ST: That's odd, what did you do in your past life?<br /> Abby: Mostly drugs.<br /> <br /> Mountain: Look upon my chiseled abdomen and wonder at the glories of heaven!<br /> <br /> ST: Having a dragonblood who can juggle rocket launchers while shooting lightning out of his ass is better than a regular soldier with one rocket launcher.<br /> <br /> ST: This is somebody else's gravity now!<br /> <br /> Mountain: So I <i>have</i> seduced her?<br /> ST: She has integrity charms.<br /> Abby: And standards.<br /> <br /> ST: Ray is killing people with math.<br /> Abby: Math has certainly made me want to die sometimes.<br /> <br /> Mountain: On the other hand, we might be able to keep it flying if we parry the ceiling hard enough.<br /> <br /> Ray: I spent years building up an immunity to implosions.<br /> <br /> Mountain: I send her a bouquet with a chainsaw in it.<br /> <br /> ST: This does mean that the internet will be wood-themed, which means it's even more for porn.<br /> Sabat: Does it mean it'll be full of lumberjack-themed porn? Because that's what we found in the East. I'm not seeing any downsides.<br /> <br /> Mountain: What's his name?<br /> ST: Ugh. He has a name.<br /> Mountain: Hasaname, I have a deal for you...<br /> <br /> ST: The Infernal Kardashians of Creation.<br /> Ray: ...So the Kardashians?<br /> <br /> Ray: We have, in fact, delivered Kim Kardashian for summary execution.<br /> <br /> ST: You have killed Kim Kardashian and replaced her with your own.<br /> <br /> Mountain: *about zombies when Abby wasn't here* Crap. I have no idea if they're supposed to be dead or not!<br /> <br /> Mountain: Millions dead! Millions dead because you wouldn't take a booze bath.<br /> <br /> Mountain: Yeah, I think if I had to pick the Sun or Moon, I'd fight Luna.<br /> Sabat: But the Sun can't lose!<br /> Mountain: But he has mercy.<br /> <br /> ST: Give me a Stamina + Larceny roll.<br /> <br /> Mountain: Grow a pair. And I don't mean arms.<br /> <br /> Ray: If it's alzheimer's Tammuz, he may very well wage a war on pancakes.<br /> <br /> Sabat: That's why the Usurpation was okay.<br /> Hacophonane: There is no proof that any of that ever happened.<br /> Sabat: That's why we destroyed the record: to prevent anyone from ever remembering the giant dick fountain.<br /> <br /> ST: White Lily appears to be a...*huge sneeze*<br /> Mountain: Oh, that poor child!<br /> <br /> ST: Arson and love are very different things!<br /> <br /> Sabat: Shut up, I'm totally dead, you don't even know, I ate some scones once.<br /> <br /> Mountain: Well, I don't have a child or any seashells, but what I do have...is <i>chainsaws in my pants!</i><br /> <br /> Mountain: I want to find my corpse and see what's in my pants.<br /> <br /> Mountain and Ray in combination: Craft: Fate is 30% Bureaucracy, 20% other people's signatures, and 50% fear of the Pattern Spiders.<br /> <br /> Mountain: Wait, you're going to let Abby look at thousands and thousands of people's lives at once? With scissors??<br /> <br /> Mountain: Iron Siaka is <i>really</i> good at keeping secrets because you ask her a question and then she punches you.<br /> <br /> Mountain: Who is that stranger who rode into town on the rhino? What stranger, I just remember the rhino!<br /> <br /> Abby: Please silence your cellphone before invading the enemy fortress.<br /> <br /> Ray: What we need to do is forge the remains of the Unconquered Sun's corpse into a giant pool-skimmer.<br /> <br /> Ray: I'm pretty sure the Deathlords [dead Autocthon] creates are Daft Punk.<br /> <br /> Mountain: Sorry, for some reason I assumed you were talking to Abby's feet. &quot;Surely the feet will give him the book!&quot;<br /> (Of note: right after this is when we discovered that Mountain didn't know Abby' real name this whole time.)<br /> <br /> Ray: Using his way of counting, we have three times more Chejop Kejak than anyone else.<br /> <br /> Abby: Can one stealthily jump over the front gate?<br /> <br /> ST: He's Captain Kirk; the hot alien scientist is always who he ends up banging!<br /> Sabat: Yeah, sure, it'll be fine, just get in this box.<br /> <br /> Hacophonane: Killing that many people would be bad for Creation for any number of reasons.<br /> ST *as NPC*: Also morally bad?<br /> Hacophonane: ...That's what I mean.<br /> <br /> Mountain: I think ding dong ditch with the Juggernaut is the way to go.<br /> <br /> Mountain: Supposition: This whole Chejop Kejak thing is a lie and you're just the Green Lady.<br /> Sabat: Supposition: Chejop Kejak was the Green Lady all along.<br /> Ray: And they're all Mirror Flag.<br /> <br /> Mountain: ...I mean, I really don't wanna seduce Han-Tha, either.<br /> <br /> Ray: I'm a very human truck.<br /> Mountain: Stop making this weird. I'm inside you, I don't want this to be weird.<br /> <br /> Mountain: I am going to flare my anima and say &quot;I am Sleeping Mountain, Chosen of Serenity, and I declare that it is time for your rest to come to an end!&quot;<br /> ST (as Pasiap): Rrrrrrgh<br /> Sabat: Holy shit, that worked?<br /> Mountain: Of course it did, I shone a bright light in his eyes.<br /> <br /> Ray: What's a good siege-scale weapon?<br /> Hacophonane: *raises hand*<br /> <br /> Sabat: Someone needs to Shun the Smiling Trump.<br /> <br /> Abby: Is your laurel going on your rearview mirror?<br /> <br /> Sabat: *as Mountain* &quot;Hi, I'm Chejop Kejak and I unleashed the Juggernaut on a civilian populace!&quot;<br /> <br /> Mountain: If Mars is in the Jacuzzi, it's not the right time to start a war.<br /> <br /> Sabat: I made you some Solars, but you eated them.<br /> <br /> Mountain: If no one else has any pressing business, I think I'm gonna sleep with Ma-Ha-Suchi and steal his casino.<br /> <br /> Sabat: I have a suggestion that none of you will like: the Bureau of Undeathstiny.<br /> <br /> Ray: What if they're strapping jet engines to birds?<br /> Mountain: I thought you <i>didn't</i> have the Great Curse!<br /> <br /> Mountain: It used to be that I could trust his judgment, but then he started listening to me.<br /> <br /> Hacophonane: I'm only Essence 5.<br /> Ray: I'm a truck.<br /> <br /> Ray: The car says &quot;Hey asshole, you like what's under the hood?&quot; as the hood pops up and instead of something incredibly inappropriate, a long metal tube pops out.<br /> <br /> Mountain: Toilet paper is a form weapon, bitches!<br /> <br /> ST: You knee him in the crotch and his head explodes.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>So I'm making <a href=\"http://godkickingboot.smackjeeves.com/\" target=\"_blank\">God-Kicking Boot</a>, an Exalted webcomic, now. Updates on Sundays. Full-color, mediocre but slowly improving art. It's a thing.<br /> <br /> The absence of a monument can, in its own way, be something of a monument also.</i> -Roger Zelazny","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","c