:"663"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-23T16:49:01-07:00","id":975278,"title":"","content":"One of my players was disappointed I missed a good one so here it is:<br /> <br /> Twlight PC: &quot;Mmm, yes, I have heard of this theory of string. They say it's everywhere.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/785-full-time-gm","name":"Full Time GM","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar785_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"174"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-24T21:31:59-07:00","id":975823,"title":"","content":"&quot;There's a new layer of the atmosphere: The food-o-sphere&quot; -PC 2<br /> <br /> <br /> &quot;I will summon a creature to eat the food. To honor our creator, it'll be a giant orb. Wakkawakkawakkawakka&quot; - PC 2<br /> <br /> <br /> &quot;This is what I do. I steal stuff from temples&quot; PC 3, &quot;No you don't!&quot; PC 2, &quot;You're right, I <i>liberate</i> stuff from temples. It belongs in a museum.&quot; PC 3<br /> <br /> <br /> &quot;Boulder gets up. You turn to your staff. 'Staff, you're kind of an asshole.'&quot; PC 2<br /> <br /> <br /> &quot;Why is your son flaunting the fact that they're stealthily visiting us?&quot; PC 1<br /> <br /> <br /> &quot;Your only choice is to find a veto buster buster&quot; ST<br /> <br /> <br /> &quot;I don't need to veto your veto. I just have to veto the veto in order to veto the veto.&quot; PC 2<br /> <br /> <br /> &quot;Here's the thing. My son finds your daughters rage delicious, PC 1. Your daughter is rebelling against everything. If she gets into a relationship with my son, maybe she'll be less rebellious against everything.&quot; PC 2 <br /> &quot;So it'll be a healthy parasitic relationship?&quot; My PC<br /> <br /> <br /> &quot;He's fine. What I'm wondering is why you're marrying my father instead of my other father.&quot; ST, as PC 1's daughter.<br /> <br /> <br /> &quot;HAHAHAHAHAHA. Sorry, that was unbecoming of me. HAHAHAHAHAHAHAHAHA&quot; My PC<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">BEHOLD! GLORIOUS SOLAR MONKEY!</span><br /> <br /> <br /> My avatar was made by <b>Jen!</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12377-raaabr","name":"raaabr","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12377_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"61"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-25T04:17:30-07:00","id":975908,"title":"","content":"PC1: &quot;Fate's a bitch!&quot;<br /> PC2: &quot;Hey.&quot;<br /> PC1: &quot;Not you.&quot;<br /> ---<br /> PC1: &quot;Bloody hell.&quot;<br /> NPC: &quot;Did someone say 'bloody'?&quot;<br /> PCs: &quot;Oh god, not him again.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8890-nullapostle","name":"NullApostle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8890_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-26T21:34:05-07:00","id":976940,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>raaabr</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.the