":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/588-webkilla","name":"webkilla","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar588_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-26T23:18:24-07:00","id":977001,"title":"","content":"Eh, the food-o-sphere stuff was mostly a hypothetical brought up as a sorcerous working, but everything else is part of the crazy crazy world we're in. I'm a relatively new player joining a group with pre-established history, so I've only recently picked up on some of the social interactions and backstories of these characters. And also I've only recently been tied into someone else's story, however that goes. So this is technically almost as out-of-context for me as it is for you.<br /> <br /> <br /> But yes, between a spontaneous engagement to Ligier, my character's insane training methods, and the fact that we're all sorcerers, we get into some pretty wacky shenanigans. All of which are excellent fodder for this thread.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">BEHOLD! GLORIOUS SOLAR MONKEY!</span><br /> <br /> <br /> My avatar was made by <b>Jen!</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12377-raaabr","name":"raaabr","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12377_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"61"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-27T22:26:17-07:00","id":977603,"title":"","content":"PC: &quot;... All alone with <i>you,</i> my dear? Sounds just fine to me... You know, you look <i>very</i> cute covered in my blood...&quot;<br /> GM: She appreciates the compliment","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Discord: HalfTangible#7505<br /> &quot;+3 Girlfriend is totally unoptimized. You are better off with a +1 Keen Witty girlfriend and then appling Greater Magic Make-up to increase her enhancement bonus.&quot; -Keld Danar on <a href=\"https://forums.giantitp.com/showthread.php?p=10856903#post10856903\" target=\"_blank\">GitP Forums</a><br /> Playing Peleps Raptor, Fire Aspect playboy in the Grand Tour","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/879-halftangible","name":"HalfTangible","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar879_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"366"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-29T19:26:56-07:00","id":978788,"title":"","content":"&quot;I think making a Banana would be ambition 1&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Everything grows after it rains, everything grows if it doesn't rain, everything grows during the day also everything grows at night&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;It's a sharknado? I have been briefed about these&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/363-muscadomestica","name":"MuscaDomestica","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar363_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"189"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-29T19:31:59-07:00","id":978790,"title":"","content":"&quot;Fire works best when it's shared with everyone.&quot;<br /> &quot;No, fire should only be controlled by the monied elite.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;I think we should try crowd sourcing this fire.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;I support a blanket ban on all fire forever.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;We can look for more fire on other worlds.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Clearly, the problem was we didn't use <i>enough </i>fire.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>On the frontier of the Wild South, there's only one woman with the grit to take on its most dangerous outlaws and bring them <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/984977-back-alive-or-maybe-dead-quest\" target=\"_blank\">Back Alive, or Maybe Dead.</a><br /> <br /> Avatar by <a href=\"http://puzzlinghappenstance.tumblr.com/\" target=\"_blank\">K.S. Brenowitz</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/908-semicasual","name":"semicasual","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar908_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2499"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-29T21:33:51-07:00","id":978844,"title":"","content":"PC2: &quot;Look man, your guy's not gonna last long in prison.&quot;<br /> PC1: &quot;You kidding? I'll be going to prison for punching a cop, they'll love me there!&quot;<br /> Group: &quot;...&quot;<br /> PC1: &quot;Oh... oh crap&quot;<br /> GM: *through snickers* &quot;Stop fighting the cop or roll to keep hold of the soap.&quot;<br /> <br /> (Also, while I can't bring the logic down to one sound bite, one other player in a game I'm in tried to convince me over the course of a day that &quot;Attempted assassination is IMPROVING relations with my enemies!&quot;)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Discord: HalfTangible#7505<br /> &quot;+3 Girlfriend is totally unoptimized. You are better off with a +1 Keen Witty girlfriend and then appling Greater Magic Make-up to increase her enhancement bonus.&quot; -Keld Danar on <a href=\"https://forums.giantitp.com/showthread.php?p=10856903#post10856903\" target=\"_blank\">GitP Forums</a><br /> Playing Peleps Raptor, Fire Aspect playboy in the Grand Tour","edited":{"userid":879,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/879-halftangible","user":"HalfTangible","date":". 09-30-2016, 12:40 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/879-halftangible","name":"HalfTangible","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar879_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"366"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-30T01:43:58-07:00","id":978925,"title":"","content":"&quot;Look.. Half the gods are Dead, the Incarnae are gone... and there is no Exalted in existence bar us.... I'm not saying we need to Summon them.. but summoning the Yozi's in accordance with the Law.... May improve the Situation... Atleast it will if we can do it before any of the OTHER threats to Creation can get here....&quot;<br /> <br /> ---------------------------------------------------------<br /> &quot;The Realm will freeze for what it has done! They destroyed my Family and hunted my husband like an Animal! He Wasn't a Demon, he wasn't Anathema, He was more human then ME!&quot;<br /> &quot;Yes... but freezing the entire continent is no way to deal with this pain, besides... that Eye your using is starting to look at you funny... you might want to... Back away slowly&quot;<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Light and Dark are two Sides of a Coin... Humanity is What Happens when it Lands on it's Edge.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3981-rickmanuk","name":"RickmanUK","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3981_2.jpeg","title":"Member","ran