"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12377_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"61"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-13T22:12:29-08:00","id":1016911,"title":"","content":"PC1: &quot;I honestly don't know if I am proud of him, or questioning my own existence.&quot;<br /> <br /> -----<br /> <br /> ST: &quot;One Bear Arm emerges from the manse, his iconic bear arm stripped off. And his iconic bare arm covered.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Murcushio: Sure, you avoid all that messy withdrawal, but you still need to <i>stop doing heroin</i> (for the purposes of this discussion your cousin is named Heroin).","edited":{"userid":4657,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4657-maxastro","user":"MaxAstro","date":". 12-14-2016, 01:35 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4657-maxastro","name":"MaxAstro","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4657_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"227"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-14T08:48:44-08:00","id":1017093,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kyman201</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/96311-the-out-of-context-game-quotes-thread?p=1014898#post1014898\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Y'know, dealing with God Bloods, elementals, and DBs, <i>this is a legitimate question</i>.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> This came up in the last session of my Exalted game, actually. One of the PCs is a lost Sidereal who thinks he's a Dragon-Blooded because he has a red aura, so he ran into a burning building sure that his &quot;fire anima&quot; would protect him. It didn't. XD","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr />&quot;The true object of all human life is play. Earth is a task garden; heaven is a playground.&quot; -G.K. Chesterton","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/53-blackwingedheaven","name":"blackwingedheaven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar53_3.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"351"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-19T09:58:03-08:00","id":1019315,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\">&quot;I shall wield this decrepit battleaxe in your name and your likeness. No, wait... just your name.&quot;</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><br /> &quot;Shouldn't you ladies be on all fours? Crap, that came out wrong...&quot;</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\">&quot;That sheep did a barrel roll.&quot;</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\">&quot;We're just going to have to take the existence of hands on faith.&quot;</span></span><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>On the frontier of the Wild South, there's only one woman with the grit to take on its most dangerous outlaws and bring them <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/984977-back-alive-or-maybe-dead-quest\" target=\"_blank\">Back Alive, or Maybe Dead.</a><br /> <br /> Avatar by <a href=\"http://puzzlinghappenstance.tumblr.com/\" target=\"_blank\">K.S. Brenowitz</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/908-semicasual","name":"semicasual","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar908_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2499"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-20T01:06:05-08:00","id":1019653,"title":"","content":"My Eclipse is a trove of these.<br /> <br /> ***<br /> <br /> NPC: ... Saffron?<br /> Eclipse: AMERA! How are you?<br /> Night: Wait, isn't she named Wind?<br /> Twilight: Well we've only known her since Calibration. She might be Wind Saffron Petals Boysenberry Smoke and she only used part of her name. Or an alias, they use those too.<br /> <br /> A Different NPC: ... You. Golden Lark.<br /> Eclipse: Oh, shit, I should have recognized the God's name. Hello, Lord Rarth, how's your daughter?<br /> NPC: As if YOU didn't know.<br /> <br /> Yet Another NPC: ... Golden Lark? *Liplock*<br /> Twilight: No one EVER slaps her when they're upset after long meetings. Double standard, I tell you.<br /> <br /> Eclipse: Oh... Um, this Queen... Shorter than you, golden hair, one braid, kind of haughty?<br /> Same NPC as previous exchange: Lark, are you implying what I think you're implying? Just <i>how many</i> maidens have you ruined men for?<br /> Eclipse: ... Okay there was you... That Queen... The ship captain... Couple of village girls... There was that one Dynast... Is <i>EIGHT</i> a lot?<br /> <br /> Ninja 1: Wait, that voice...<br /> Ninja 2: VIDA?!<br /> Eclipse: ... Mist? Melody? What are YOU doing here? And WHY are you kidnapping young girls?<br /> Twilight: Is THIS what it's like for others?<br /> <br /> Eclipse: Am I invited to the wedding?<br /> Twilight: Assuming you don't take a midnight schooner off the pier under the false name of the Grim Fandango, deadly dancer under the stars, before the ceremony.<br /> Eclipse: Psh. I wouldn't call myself the Grim Fandango. You'd call a SHIP the Grim Fandango. Or a gang. The Grim Fandangos. Actually that's a pretty good name.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":2142,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","user":"Kyman201","date":". 12-20-2016, 04:37 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","name":"Kyman201","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2142_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-20T02:39:43-08:00","id":1019669,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kyman201</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/96311-the-out-of-context-game-quotes-thread?p=1019653#post1019653\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">My Eclipse is a trove of these.</div> </div> </div> </div>My Night Caste from the same game isn't <i>quite</i> as productive, but he's had some fun times as well:<br /> <br /> --<br /> <br /> &quot;And Calibration comes to an end, wit'...Roosters.&quot;<br /> <br /> <br /> &quot;Well in that case, we'd just haul him into a yeddim pen and let nature take its course.&quot;<br /> <br /> <br /> Eclipse: &quot;She look familiar? Maybe you stole something from her?&quot;<br /> Night: &quot;It is...possible....that she may be a lady from whom I, from necessity of course, relieved some weaponry from-&quot;<br /> Lunar: &quot;YOU! I challenge you, Thief! You took my Sifu's sword!&quot;<br /> Dawn: &quot;Oh, a rivaly of a martial school.&quot; <i>Clearly they must fight each other to the death at sundown!</i><br /> <br /> <br /> &quot;A good old piratical barbecue sounds reasonable to me.&quot;<br /> <br /> <br /> Lunar: &quot;Time for you to get hit in the nose again.&quot;<br /> Twilight: &quot;The things I do for our group.&quot;<br /> Night: &quot;Your sacrifice will be remembered.&quot;<br /> <br /> <br /> Twilight: &quot;I...may know someone, though I'd have to get a message to...her...&quot; <i>*Every woman in the room looks at him*</i> &quot;....well, I do.&quot;<br /> Night: &quot;And this is the moment in which nobody here is surprised.&quot;<br /> <br /> <br /> &quot;Never question the abilities of a maid, I have found.&quot;<br /> <br /> <br /> &quot;Will the Third Circle Demons please take a number and form an orderly line?&quot;<br /> <br /> <br /> &quot;...okay, I wasn't expecting an arm-spider.&quot;<br /> <br /> <br /> &quot;...okay, don't make the Blood Ape angry.&quot;<br /> &quot;Okay...don't make the <i>sorcerer</i> angry, either.&quot;<br /> &quot;...really, REALLY <i>don't make him angry!</i>&quot;<br /> <br /> <br /> &quot;...he's going to need new pants once he slows down.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":6118,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6118-thebushranger","user":"TheBushranger","date":". 12-20-2016, 05:42 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6118-thebushranger","name":"TheBushranger","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6118_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-20T12:56:43-08:00","id":1019935,"title":"","content":"The first session of my new game had a couple of good ones.<br /> ST: &quot;None of you are going to go say hi to each other ? Really? I get you alone together and you're all just going to sit there silently?&quot;<br /> <br /> Zenith (straight face): &quot;What's integrity?&quot;<br /> <br /> Twilight: &quot;Oh, it's ok, I drugged myself too.&quot;<br /> <br /> Eclipse: &quot;If you ever try to change my mind with magic again, I will murder you.&quot;<br /> Zenith: &quot;Then I suggest you stand outside the amphitheater during future performances.&quot;<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9510-bluewinds","name":"BlueWinds","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9510_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"554"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-22T16:27:00-08:00","id":1021067,"title":"","content":"Teenage NPC: &quot;Why does this paper smell delicious?&quot; (licks the paper)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"left\"><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">She/Her. I am literal-minded and write literally. If I don't say something explicitly, please never assume I implied it. The only exception is if I try to make a joke.</span></span></span></div> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">My point of view may be different from yours but is equally valid.</span></span></span><br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1x1ycoxJF0G9niMt5D3Pp7owZ7tw8AJvL?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted-cWoD-ArM url mega-library</a>. Exalted <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/663334-random-name-