 Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&quot;Yay, I'm no longer racist! I shot my racism away!&quot;<br /> <br /> LATER...<br /> <br /> &quot;Guys, for me to use this Charm again, I need to do consciously racist stuff... but I'm no longer a racist, so that's gonna be a bit of a problem...&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> this is oddly specific - yet curiously tantalising. Please explain","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malfeas F'Tagn - go check out my epic MLP/Exalted crossover &quot;The Scroll of Exalted ponies&quot; @ Fimfiction","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/588-webkilla","name":"webkilla","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar588_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-02T15:31:25-07:00","id":1136737,"title":"","content":"I'm playing a Dune People Zenith, who thinks that all non-Dune People are lesser, weak beings and that the long years of surviving in the desert have made the Dune People the hardiest, most capable humans. He has a Defining Principle about this.<br /> <br /> Archery Charm Phantom Arrow Technique allows you to use your Intimacy for a damage boost, but it numbs the Intimacy. And you can't use the Charm again until you have regained the Intimacy through roleplaying it, specifically &quot;spent significant effort in restoring or remembering the Intimacy&quot; <br /> <br /> Sooo, if I want to use that Charm again, I need to regain my racist views :P","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/15678-cenrei","name":"Cenrei","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar15678_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"73"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-03T12:46:02-07:00","id":1136996,"title":"","content":"PC: &quot;Did we almost accidentally enslave these people?&quot;<br /> Other PC: &quot;Almost?&quot;<br /> Other other PC: &quot;Accidentally?&quot;<br /> <br /> PC: &quot;To lend credibility to his argument, I'm dripping with vomit.&quot;<br /> <br /> PC: &quot;One of us has to masturbate. &lt;Dawn player&gt;, can you start War Lion Stance? Who has the least Stamina?&quot;<br /> *silence*<br /> Same PC: &quot;Oh, f- oh we could just use blood, can't we. I'm sorry, I'm running on autopilot.&quot;<br /> *silence*<br /> Same PC: &quot;I mean not autopilot, I mean I don't automatically...fuck.&quot;<br /> <br /> PC: &quot;I collect the meat in a reverent silence, the secret darkness of the Sun seeming to swallow-&quot;<br /> ST: &quot;No. No, you can't stunt this.&quot;<br /> PC: &quot;-with a wall-kick off a nearby pillar and/or tree, my grim burden squirting-&quot;<br /> ST: &quot;I'll give you a three-pointer right now for your silence.&quot;<br /> <br /> ----<br /> <br /> PC: &quot;Can you tell them I'm the messiah?&quot;<br /> Other PC: *somehow slips a note to the ST without first PC seeing him write it*<br /> Other PC: &quot;He's the messiah, your chosen one.&quot;<br /> Villagers: *laughing and cheering*<br /> PC: &quot;I nod serenely and raise my hand to the crowd. After entirely too much bullshit this week, Crown Quest 2017 BEGINS.&quot;<br /> <br /> *after session, PC picks up the note because the ST has terrible notebook discipline*<br /> <br /> PC: &quot;'This man has buggered a dozen of your goats, but don't worry. We have come to arrest him, and return him to Hell.'&quot;<br /> PC: &quot;My Intimacy of hatred for you guys is Defining, by the way.&quot;<br /> <br /> ----<br /> <br /> PC: &quot;Can I use Flawless Pickpocketing Technique to larcenously plant something?&quot;<br /> ST: &quot;Uh, such as?&quot;<br /> Other PC: &quot;A kiss on those lips ey bay-beeeee&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":8}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1075-kingdom-of-one","name":"Kingdom of One","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"140"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-03T22:28:33-07:00","id":1137196,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Cenrei</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/96311-the-out-of-context-game-quotes-thread?p=1136737#post1136737\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm playing a Dune People Zenith, who thinks that all non-Dune People are lesser, weak beings and that the long years of surviving in the desert have made the Dune People the hardiest, most capable humans. He has a Defining Principle about this.<br /> <br /> Archery Charm Phantom Arrow Technique allows you to use your Intimacy for a damage boost, but it numbs the Intimacy. And you can't use the Charm again until you have regained the Intimacy through roleplaying it, specifically &quot;spent significant effort in restoring or remembering the Intimacy&quot;<br /> <br /> Sooo, if I want to use that Charm again, I need to regain my racist views :P</div> </div> </div> </div>its stories like this that make me love this game","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malfeas F'Tagn - go check out my epic MLP/Exalted crossover &quot;The Scroll of Exalted ponies&quot; @ Fimfict