ode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>vampire hunter D</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/96311-the-out-of-context-game-quotes-thread?p=1308440#post1308440\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Try a few searches on PornHub for that answer</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm not a mod or anything, but could you not do this? For one, there's bound to be some Exalted fans who're under the age of eighteen; for another, it's off-topic, bordering on advertising.<br /> <br /> <i>Anyway</i>, some out-of-context game quotes.<br /> <br /> Invisible Horse Princess: &quot;Everyone be careful not to wake up the horde of zombies hidden under the water. One of those always means George A. Romero is nearby.&quot;<br /> <br /> ----------<br /> <br /> Robin: &quot;I give praise to Sweetlea, the Kenning Quill, Hero of the Age of Restoring Dawn, They who brought Glory to Ideals itself. We have come to mourn the passing of one who is deserving, They who had brought light to both the darkest place and the darkest mind and made them righteous. &quot;<br /> Ghost: &quot;Tours are closed until maintenance is finished!&quot;<br /> Robin: &quot;A tomb as beautiful as this can only be fixed by one such as I, let us through.&quot; [roll]<br /> \u200bGhost: &quot;We've waited a long time for you.&quot;<br /> <br /> ----------<br /> <br /> ST: At the midpoint along the wall is a giant stone shape that only somewhat resembles a human. Its hands hold the shaft of a crank too massive for even Kithri to move easily. As you enter it turns its head blankly toward you, but says nothing.<br /> Invisible Horse Princess: &quot;Sup,&quot; Princess says to the statue with a head nod.<br /> ST: The figure shrugs its shoulders and looks inquisitive.<br /> <br /> ----------<br /> <br /> Taroketu Kithri: Kithri nodded her thanks to the golem.<br /> ST: The golem gives a thumbs-up.<br /> Invisible Horse Princess: Princess gives the golem a fist bump as she passes by.<br /> <br /> ----------<br /> <br /> Invisible Horse Princess: As she follows along with the others, Princess is paying attention not to the incredible treasure trove of history here, but to signs of boobytraps. An ancient tomb was bound to have at least one spike pit, wall that shoots dozens of poisoned arrows, or giant boulder.<br /> And if it didn't, she was gonna be pissed.<br /> <br /> ----------<br /> <br /> Spirit: &quot;She was his first wife. He interred her remains when his Lunar mate killed her.&quot;<br /> Robin Vaara: &quot;Oh... She must have been very close to his heart. If I may ask you, what is a Lunar mate exactly?&quot;<br /> ST: The spirit is stumped by that one.<br /> Taroketu Kithri: Kithri silently wondered if Davos would technically be her Lunar mate.<br /> Robin Vaara: &quot;WHY WON'T YOU TELL ME WHAT A LUNAR MATE IS!?&quot;<br /> <br /> ----------<br /> <br /> ST: The blue curtain magically stops anyone who's under eighteen from going through.\u200b","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":177,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","user":"TheCountAlucard","date":". 04-28-2019, 07:13 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-28T17:50:46-07:00","id":1308553,"title":"","content":"\u201cShadow sounds like the kind of name you would give to someone sneaky. I could see someone with that name being me.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cI found some pictures, some of them are probably of your past selves. If you want to see what they actually looked like.\u201d<br /> \u201cI <i>am</i> curious, on the other hand I\u2019m worried she\u2019ll be attractive and I won\u2019t have the faintest idea what to call that.\u201d<br /> <br /> ST: \u201cA working that changed the actual constellations of Creation would probably do it, but is also probably harder than just making the binding permanent.\u201d<br /> Player 1: \u201cThis sort of thing is why Solars make Sidereals uncomfortable.\u201d<br /> Player 2: \u201cFor starters doing that would likely change Sidereal Charms.\u201d<br /> ST: \u201cYes. Yes it would.\u201d<br /> Player 2: \u201cNo no, hear me out, we can rewrite the stars to make Sidereal Charms <i>better</i>. It\u2019ll be great.\u201d","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13313-sith_happens","name":"Sith_Happens","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13313_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1177"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-30T12:35:17-07:00","id":1308990,"title":"","content":"P1: &quot;I am so going to probe me some ghosts&quot;<br /> P2: &quot;Mindprobe or anal-probe?&quot;<br /> P1: &quot;Does that entirely matter?&quot;<br /> <br /> <br /> P1: &quot;We should draw a dick on our manse - that seems to ward off women we don't want coming after us there&quot;<br /> <br /> <br /> ST: &quot;guys - how much downtime you want to take to upgrade your characters all depends on how much you dare wait until the bad guys make their move. Do you want to risk spending three weeks and then hearing that another city got leveled?&quot;<br /> All players: &quot;Time for essence 4 then!&quot;<br /> ST: *facepalm*<br /> P3: &quot;Shaming us at this point is futile...&quot;<br /> P4: &quot;Lets wait two weeks then What's the worst thing that could happen?&