where over there. Oh, by the way, I'm using 'toilet' metaphorically here. Don't look for a literal toilet. Besides, we're on the north side of town, so they'd just be outhouses.&quot;<br /> &quot;Oh, you mean watch out for shit?&quot;<br /> &quot;Yes. Shit can go down anywhere here.&quot;<br /> <br /> <br /> &quot;You see a series of bodies hanging from lampposts.&quot;<br /> &quot;I never understood modern art.&quot;<br /> &quot;I think it's a metaphor for 'we're fucked'.&quot;<br /> &quot;Yes, very on-the-nose...&quot;<br /> <br /> <br /> &quot;I once toured Nexus. I was only robbed three times, so I consider it a pretty successful trip.&quot;<br /> <br /> <br /> \u201cWe're a traveling band! We'll play the liveliest songs the dead have ever heard!&quot;<br /> &quot;Sadly, that's not my cup of tea.&quot;<br /> &quot;Oh. Rap fans.&quot;<br /> <br /> <br /> &quot;I'll be honest, I wasn't expecting you to befriend the giant, undead cow.&quot;<br /> &quot;Way to go, Rakis!&quot;<br /> <br /> <br /> &quot;Man, Nexus is WAY over their daily quota for homicides today.&quot;<br /> <br /> <br /> &quot;Please, sir, spare me! I only stole the bread to feed my baby!&quot;<br /> &quot;That lady is clearly crazy. Babies don't eat bread.&quot;<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> &quot;YOU! KILLED! ME!&quot;<br /> &quot;I'm sorry, I hear that a lot. Who is this?&quot;<br /> <br /> <br /> &quot;Life is wasted on the living.&quot;<br /> &quot;Y'know, you're probably not wrong.&quot;<br /> &quot;... Wow.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1586,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","user":"Dietaku","date":". 10-20-2019, 02:45 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key"