quot;<br /> &lt;Storyteller&gt; &quot;Let's get the firing squad set up then.&quot; Akashi says as they get into position and stat to prepare their catapult.<br /> &lt;Storyteller&gt; The firing team pulls back the catapult, loads the stone, then lets it go. It soars through the air and crashes into the pile of rocks with a loud crash<br /> &lt;Azeneth&gt; &quot;I think we could make this a sport&quot;<br /> &lt;Storyteller&gt; &quot;Maybe.&quot;<br /> &lt;Artemesia&gt; &quot;Involving rhinos or in general?&quot;<br /> &lt;Azeneth&gt; &quot;I see no reason to exclude other animals large enough to put a catapult on&quot;<br /> &lt;Storyteller&gt; &quot;Are we prepared then?&quot;<br /> &lt;Kalire&gt; &quot;that could get pretty abusive, my sister has a lady who can control cephalopods have you seen how big they can get?&quot;<br /> &lt;Azeneth&gt; &quot;no, but don't they lack bones?&quot;<br /> &lt;Artemesia&gt; &quot;Seems we need a standardised playing area to mitigate this problem. Then the sister game can be ocean based.&quot;<br /> &lt;Azeneth&gt; &quot;I think a reasonable game should be able to include a large lake&quot;<br /> &lt;Kalire&gt; &quot;Gin are we missing anything?&quot;<br /> &lt;Jiro_Gin&gt; &quot;Maybe some extra armour for it?&quot;<br /> &lt;Azeneth&gt; &quot;we're missing a name! how about catapult dominos?&quot;<br /> &lt;Kalire&gt; &quot;why dominos?&quot;<br /> &lt;Azeneth&gt; &quot;because you spend hours setting them up and then you, or someone with much less patience knocks them all over...&quot;<br /> &lt;Kalire&gt; &quot;that's not how you play dominos!&quot;<br /> &lt;Jiro_Gin&gt; &quot;...wait, I thought you meant for the fight not the game&quot;<br /> &lt;Azeneth&gt; &quot;wait, it's not?&quot;<br /> &lt;Storyteller&gt; &quot;Excuse me, my ladies we really need to go.&quot; the tribes leader says as the Rhino starts moving with its payload. &quot;The creature has been spotted.&quot;<br /> &lt;Kalire&gt; &quot;dominos have numbers on for a reason, you're supposed to align...&quot;<br /> &lt;Jiro_Gin&gt; &quot;Ok, explain later&quot;<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-03T10:53:12-08:00","id":1345612,"title":"","content":"P1: What language is he speaking in?<br /> ST: Uh... Riverspeak.<br /> P1: I ask him, in High Realm, if he speaks any language other than &quot;peasant&quot;.<br /> ST: ... But, you speak Riverspeak.<br /> P1: Not to poor people.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-the-official-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=899399#post899399\" target=\"_blank\">Hi, I'm JohnDoe244</a>. My posts represent my opinions, not facts.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","name":"JohnDoe244","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar531_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2958"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-05T11:11:41-08:00","id":1346220,"title":"","content":"P1: &quot;its not very normal to turn off your nose, even if we're not that normal&quot;<br /> <br /> P2: &quot;yes of course,I'm very merciful - I only dropped him down the sewer after it had it had been lubricated with blood and gore&quot;<br /> <br /> p2: &quot;The perfume scares my. I don't know why&quot;<br /> <br /> p1: &quot;I could jam my hand up its butt and use it as a sock puppet&quot;<br /> st: &quot;P3's character or the undead monster?<br /> p1:&quot; P3's character - I don't think the undead monster has a butt&quot;<br /> <br /> p2: &quot;Does it have a functional hole in the rear? It can't say no...&quot;<br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malfeas F'Tagn - go check out my epic MLP/Exalted crossover &quot;The Scroll of Exalted ponies&quot; @ Fimfiction","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/588-webkilla","name":"webkilla","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar588_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-12T11:06:47-08:00","id":1347963,"title":"","content":"p1: &quot;Hey, when I say stupid things it never ends too badly - people just assume I'm a moron&quot;<br /> <br /> p1: &quot;They aren't beating on me and my armor with their clubs, I'm beating on them with me&quot;<br /> <br /> p2: &quot;I don't like this game anymore&quot;<br /> <br /> p3: &quot;Problem solving: we just take people to the ocean in the underworld and wash them&quot;<br /> <br /> p3: &quot;Shall I try to touch myself while looking at the ghost captain?&quot;<br /> <br /> p2: &quot;Perception is a social stat&quot;<br /> <br /> p3: &quot;it can't possibly get any worse&quot;<br /> <br /> p2: &quot;we could always drown ourselves before he does it&quot;<br /> <br /> p2: &quot;I just want to point out - I'm not fat, I'm just thick&quot;<br /> <br /> p2: &quot;Oh so the Silver Prince is a necrophiliac... makes sense&quot;<br /> <br /> p2: &quot;I assume it still tastes salty&quot;<br /> <br /> p2: &quot;Now that we have essence again, we can feed each other - we just need to lick each other. We'll have to shoot it high and far, try to aim right, then lick it up&quot;<br /> <br /> p3: &quot;nothing can go wrong here - at worst we'll end up at the bottom of the ocean&quot;<br /> <br /> p2: &quot;we can't fly because I can't whip it out&quot;<br /> <br /> p1: &quot;No I won't, you're not my daddy&quot;<br /> <br /> p4: &quot;wow you rolled poorly&quot;<br /> p2: &quot;welcome to my world&quot;<br /> <br /> p1: &quot;I want to mike tyson a zombie&quot;<br /> <br /> p3: &quot;I would stunt it.... but considering how I've rolled today, then that would just make things worse&quot;<br /> <br /> p2: &quot;Fluff is important, really important&quot;<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malfeas F'Tagn - go check out my epic MLP/Exalted crossover &quot;The Scroll of Exalted ponies&quot; @ Fimfiction","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/588-webkilla","name":"webkilla","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar588_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-16T21:12:09-08:00","id":1348996,"title":"","content":"&quot;Kharas, do you know these clowns?&quot;<br /> &quot;That's a very specific way of asking that.&quot;<br /> <br /> <br /> &quot;Wait... so like... the streets are just lined with juggalos?&quot;<br /> &quot;No, just clowns.&quot;<br /> <br /> <br /> &quot;A tall figure, clad in bucket helmet, begins extolling the explicit virtue of work!&quot;<br /> &quot;Um. Arbeit macht frei?&quot;<br /> &quot;Man, I did NAZI see that coming.&quot;<br /> <br /> <br /> &quot;So, we can safely assume he's against our goals...&quot;<br /> &quot;Of saving orphans.&quot;<br /> &quot;Right.&quot;<br /> &quot;I think it's safe to assume it's a bad guy then.&quot;<br /> <br /> <br /> &quot;And then Zatch was no longer Zatch. He was... SLAPPO!&quot;<br /> &quot;The lost Marx Brother&quot;<br /> <br /> <br /> &quot;These bags are amazing! Can you teach me to make them?&quot;<br /> &quot;Sure, but you need to kill deep-sea Nhaugas.&quot;<br /> &quot;Sounds like NHAUGA problem!&quot;<br /> <br /> <br /> &quot;The monster grips you with its massive jaws, around your middle.&quot;<br /> &quot;Am I head inside or head outside?&quot;<br /> &quot;That's what she said.&quot;<br /> &quot;Jesus, dude,&quot;<br /> <br /> <br /> &quot;You just fired randomly in the direction of a major city?!&quot;<br /> &quot;We're on the OTHER SIDE OF THE WORLD!&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-24T13:38:42-08:00","id":1350696,"title":"","content":"&quot;Hi,I just met you, and this is crazy, but here's my number, now supply my army.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/14713-chronos12","name":"Chronos12","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar14713_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"56"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-03T11:08:09-08:00","id":1352391,"title":"","content":"p1: &quot;I file this plan under washing machine&quot;<br /> p2: &quot;I approve of this plan&quot;<br /> p3: &quot;of all the reasons you approve of my plan... this is the worst&quot;<br /> p2: &quot;are you washing-machine-phobic?&quot;<br /> p3: &quot;You snitch&quot;<br /> p2: &quot;this is now a combi-washer-dryer plan&quot;<br /> p3: &quot;...&quot;<br /> <br /> p2: &quot;My stunt is that I make a gorrila howl as I grab the ghost's ass and yeet it&quot;<br /> st: &quot;what does a gorrilla howl sound like?&quot;<br /> p2: &quot;tusken raider?&quot;<br /> st: &quot;you get 3 stunt dice&quot;<br /> p2: *says it as the dice are rolled*<br /> st: &quot;that sounded so deeply intelligent&quot;<br /> <br /> p2: &quot;How much yolo are we on?&quot;<br /> <br /> st: &quot;My brain broke when you said stormtrooper&quot;<br /> <br /> p1 &quot;I spend a point of willpower to grab the hat!&quot;<br /> <br /> p2: &quot;I rename the plan the double-tumble-drier plan!&quot;<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malfeas F'Tagn - go check out my epic MLP/Exalted crossover &quot;The Scroll of Exalted ponies&quot; @ Fimfiction","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/588-webkilla","name":"webkilla","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar588_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-28T21:58:11-08:00","id":1357456,"title":"","content":"&quot;I'll take the wheel. You control the rudder. That way, we avoid a RUDDER disaster.&quot;<br /> <br /> <br /> &quot;Congrats, you narrowly avoided being hit by a 400 lb tuna!&quot;<br /> &quot;I wish you wouldn't say such mean things about my ex-girlfriends.&quot;<br /> <br /> <br /> &quot;If I die, I want my epitaph to read 'IT WAS ZATCH'S FAULT'.&quot;<br /> &quot;You know we already have it engraved.&quot;<br /> &quot;I appreciate you.&quot;<br /> <br /> <br /> &quot;I might be a pessimist, though.&quot;<br /> &quot;I find that synonmous with 'well prepared'.&quot;<br /> <br /> <br /> &quot;Despite the fact that you just mauled with an axe, I cannot find an injury. But you should really drink less.&quot;<br /> &quot;You really should... you less.&quot;<br /> <br /> <br /> &quot;So, in addition to being a master hunter, you're telling me you're also a master... baiter?&quot;<br /> <br /> <br /> &quot;What are you doing here?!&quot;<br /> &quot;Would you believe it's Zatch's fault?&quot;<br /> &quot;Yes. Very yes.&quot;<br /> <br /> <br /> &quot;Something important is coming.&quot;<br /> &quot;Go on.&quot;<br /> &quot;It's a yellow arrow that say 'To be Continued'.&quot;<br /> &quot;Oh, thank God. I was afraid I was the only one who could see that!&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-29T09:08:15-08:00","id":1357551,"title":"","content":"Me: Less chatter more stabbing.<br /> Melody: I also can't wait for you to stab someone with your hammer.<br /> <br /> Melody: So... I use Nock-and-Canter Unity to shoot the lion.<br /> ST: You have to aim first, it's at Long range.<br /> Melody: Yeah uh... Nock let's me aim reflexively once per scene<br /> ST: Ok, awesome. Make your attack roll.<br /> *Rolls*<br /> ST: Yeah that Crashes the lion.<br /> Me: Much evocative. World building.<br /> ST: Ladden with Essence, your magnificent shot flies true, whipping past the lead lion with preternatural grace and speed. The arrow leaves a shallow, but undoubtedly scarring, wound on the lion's face. The wound is utterly demoralizing and gives you perfect ranging for your next shot. The lions move up to Medium.<br /> Me: I move to Short and take Earth Dragon Form.<br /> Melody: My turn again right? I try a Decisive attack... thingy this time. Same dice pool but no Accuracy bonus right?<br /> ST: They're only at Short from Ganan. They're Medium to you so you have to Aim.<br /> Melody: Crashing a foe resets Nock-and-Canter Unity so I can Aim Reflexively for 4m.<br /> ST: Fine. Roll.<br /> *Rolls*<br /> ST: The shot hits square between the eyes, killing the lion.<br /> Me: Awesome. Killing a foe resets Nock-and-Canter Unity.<br /> ST: Oh come on!<br /> <br /> Me *waist deep in Incapacitated enemy soliders*: We come in peace!<br /> ST: Yeah... that'd be more convincing it you hadn't screamed &quot;Kill them all!&quot; at the start of the combat.<br /> Melody: When we meet the guys we've come to bargain with, maybe let me do the talking.<br /> ST: Yeah... these are the guys you've come to bargain with.<br /> Me: To be fair, I did not expect them to speak High Realm.<br /> <br /> Me: They're solitary hunters.<br /> Melody: Lionesses?<br /> Me: Bobcats.<br /> ST: More like White Panthas.<br /> Me: My least favorite reboot.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-the-official-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=899399#post899399\" target=\"_blank\">Hi, I'm JohnDoe244</a>. My posts represent my opinions, not facts.","edited":{"userid":531,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","user":"JohnDoe244","date":". 12-29-2019, 12:17 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","name":"JohnDoe244","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar531_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2958"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-07T11:51:45-08:00","id":1359537,"title":"","content":"ST: &quot;You see this giant mountain sized carving of a human figure in the mountains to your south, as you fly in from the sea. What do&quot;<br /> P1: &quot;You know what I wanna do&quot;<br /> ST: *sigh* Just say it...<br /> p1:&quot;I want to pee on it to show dominance&quot;<br /> <br /> and thus our first 2020 session took less than 30 seconds to get very silly<br /> <br /> <br /> p2: &quot;We've read the scroll... can I eat it now?&quot;<br /> <br /> <br /> sidereal: &quot;please try to prevent all these deaths&quot;<br /> p1: &quot;come on, not so much with the negative attitude&quot;<br /> <br /> <br /> ST: &quot;Hold on... why would you want to bring weight-loss food to the underworld?&quot;<br /> <br /> <br /> p1: &quot;We need to save the abyssal - otherwise we can't employ her in our brothel&quot;<br /> <br /> <br /> p3: &quot;OOC, I know it would too petty for my character, but I want to sew her tent shut&quot;<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malfeas F'Tagn - go check out my epic MLP/Exalted crossover &quot;The Scroll of Exalted ponies&quot; @ Fimfiction","edited":{"userid":588,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/588-webkilla","user":"webkilla","date":". 01-06-2021, 09:20 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/588-webkilla","name":"webkilla","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar588_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-12T07:41:41-08:00","id":1360514,"title":"","content":"&quot;Do I know you? You look familiar somehow.&quot;<br /> &quot;That depends on which one-eyed bit of him you were looking at.&quot;<br /> <br /> <br /> &quot;These librarians drive a hard bargain.&quot;<br /> &quot;That's not all they drive that's hard.&quot;<br /> <br /> <br /> &quot;Roll to carry the barrel.&quot;<br /> &quot;My big br