er joining us?<br /> Melody: Yes.<br /> Me: No.<br /> Jinebar: Hi.<br /> Me: This is fine too.<br /> <br /> Melody: Of course slave collars exist in 3E!<br /> <br /> Jinebar: I'm not even in this game!<br /> Me: Sure you are. You are a magistrate now.<br /> Jinebar: That sounds important!<br /> Me: Also you are in prison.<br /> Melody: Jailbreak.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-the-official-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=899399#post899399\" target=\"_blank\">Hi, I'm JohnDoe244</a>. My posts represent my opinions, not facts.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","name":"JohnDoe244","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar531_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2958"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-23T03:47:55-07:00","id":1398319,"title":"","content":"We finished a 2 year long campaign this week, and now one of the players is becoming the new ST for &quot;Season 2&quot; (we will keep the same characters). These are taken from our chat group:<br /> <br /> New ST: I can't wait to run some side stories with you one on one to test your abilities<br /> Twilight Crafter: Is this some kind of Non-Crafter joke I'm too prodigy to understand?<br /> <br /> Player: This is a glacial melt, highland stream. Where did [Otter Familiar] catch a 500 pound marlin?<br /> Otter: Cheep Chirp (I aint gotta explain shit)<br /> <br /> Player: No, Otter! That's not a coconut, that's a human head!<br /> <br /> Player: It is great that you give local children a ride on your back at the beach, and it is great that you can dive 500m to battle giant squid, but please, PLEASE do not do those 2 things at the same time. <br /> <br /> Player: For the last two years, when we rolled decisive damage rolls it was our intiative x our Essence(or 5, whichever is higher), right? That\u2019s how I\u2019ve been doing it.<br /> Me: ....<br /> Me: wat<br /> <br /> Player: I'm surprised you even know what a decisive attack is<br /> P2: Yeah I saw you do one and wanted to try it<br /> <br /> Otter: They told me no more anchovies, i told them no more lifes<br /> <br /> Player: I wanna see who's cult wins, the Otter or the Midsommar Zenith Girl<br /> Everyone: The Otter.<br /> The Survival Twilight: I want to say Midsommar Zenith, because she can talk<br /> Midsommar: Thank you<br /> Survival Twilight: All the Otter can do is create situations where she dies. <br /> <br /> Player: So all these soul-infused medals were for nothing?<br /> P2: I mean, why make ghost infused cult tokens if you aren't going to use them in macabre works for the dark gods?<br /> <br /> Survival Twilight: If you try to drown Midsommar Zenith again, there'll be no snacks for a month<br /> Otter: She was drowned when we found her<br /> <br /> Player: The otter has his own room?<br /> Survival Twilight: It used to belong to some orphans before they found out what an anglerfish looks like first-hand<br /> Player: wow, you're really pushing the child murder plot point<br /> Survival Twilight: Its called Flavor Text<br /> <br /> Survival Twilight: Otter can roll into a ball and radiate an aura of soft adorability that adds a -5 penalty to all rolls against him<br /> ST: CANON<br /> <br /> Survival Twilight: Dont worry Midsommar , the otter cried on you and saved you from Glorious Matyrdom!<br /> Midsommar Zenith: I literally resent you for that. <br /> Midsommar Zenith: *kicking the ground* Let Me Be A Martyyyyyyyrrrrr<br /> Player: &quot;Midsommar Will Remember This&quot;<br /> <br /> Demon Summoning Crafter, to Pirate Lord Ecplise: I don't understand why every battle is not just callously sending hordes of utterly replaceable sailors at anyone in your way, drowning them in bodies. <br /> <br /> Player: Oh no, your blood sword is slaked by the unjustly slain sacrifices of the Northern Death Cult, remember?<br /> P2: Even if there\u2019s no real benefit to having more blood, i feel like swinging it around and soaking everyone in excess blood will really help us recruit the next sailors on the Ten Thousand Lemmings or whatever the crew is called. [Note: The Free Waves, on a ship called the 10 Thousand Tides]<br /> P1: The Free Lives?<br /> P2: The Disposable Waves?<br /> P1: The Blood Bank?<br /> P2: The Free Corpse?<br /> P3: Do you mean Free Corps?<br /> P2: No. <br /> <br /> Demon Summoner: *jots in notebook* Human lives have... intrinsic worth (?? research)<br /> <br /> Demon Summoner: You know, most problems in life are solvable by throwing demons at it<br /> <br /> Midsommar Zenith: &quot;Why would anyone just have Fae Gossamer on them? Do you know where that comes from!?&quot;<br /> The two players who traded a dozen shipwrecked sailors for said gossamer: *nervous aside glance*<br /> Player: Losing a source of quick abundant supersoldiers. It won't come up, don't worry<br /> <br /> Player: Ok, so besides crafting, what do you do?<br /> Twilight Crafter: I don't understand the question<br /> <br /> Player:My fear going forward:<br /> &quot;<i>ST:you encounter an elemental lord.<br /> Former ST: Using an obscure loophole found in the apocrypha, i melt them all instantly and harvest their loot all to myself.<br /> ST: this whole session was planned around the fight&quot;</i><br /> Former ST: I can actually do that 3 times per session. <br /> ST: What makes you think I plan?<br /> Survival Twilight with unkillable Otter familiar: I have trouble believing that the players could so easily ruin something the DM planned out in advance<br /> <br /> Player: I might take Steel Devil<br /> P2: That's a two sword style<br /> P1: oh i need another sword<br /> P2: <i>Player 1: owns 100 swords. Player 1: Knows the world's best sword-smith. Player 1: Where will I ever find another sword?</i><br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Please be warned: this is not champagne, this is most likely a duck.<br /> -<i>Chausse</i><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#800080\"><i>Message me for Japanese translations.</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8830-sorcerous-overlord","name":"Sorcerous Overlord","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8830_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"873"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-30T13:34:29-07:00","id":1400170,"title":"","content":"ST: &quot;So, I hope you guys can remember what happened last sesion?&quot;<br /> P1: &quot;We didn't doom the world&quot;<br /> <br /> <br /> P1: &quot;are we the baddies?&quot;<br /> ST: &quot;You ask this every session... usually with good reason, but still, you ask it every session&quot;<br /> P1: &quot;I know...&quot;<br /> <br /> ST: &quot;The library is in the crotch&quot;<br /> <br /> P1: &quot;You get turned on by rocks and dirt&quot;<br /> P2: &quot;Since when?&quot;<br /> p1: &quot;We know that lie awake at night, thinking of rocks&quot;<br /> p2: &quot;don't project your own fetishes on me&quot;<br /> P1: &quot;I think of rocks in mouth...&quot;<br /> <br /> p3: &quot;We can have up to three good ideas per session - no more&quot;<br /> <br /> ST: &quot;The coach thinks you tried to buy some intimate one-on-one time with his horse&quot;<br /> p1: &quot;Exactly what I was thinking - that's not a botch, I'm just trying to recruit for my brothel&quot;<br /> <br /> city guards: &quot;What is your business here?&quot;<br /> p1: &quot;We seek the crown jewels of the crotch&quot;<br /> <br /> ST: &quot;Your shoulder-massage makes the monk bust a nut and pass out&quot;<br /> p1: &quot;Worth it&quot;","si